{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20264ucp21kaDa1795354931.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>烏克蘭指俄軍襲擊住宅大廈，可能有多人被困。</p><p></p><p>烏克蘭總統澤連斯基表示，俄羅斯無人機周日上午襲擊烏克蘭首都基輔，一座五層高的住宅大廈，造成大廈部分倒塌，兩人受傷，至少有14人可能困在瓦礫。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.VAR.UKRAINE-2300.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026hv7vWuotL31795354940.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>俄方則表示用無人機打擊了為烏軍服務的能源設施，港口基礎設施和船隻，俄羅斯防空部隊在多地擊落了170架烏克蘭無人機。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T14:03:54.173354+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T12:13:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T14:37:18.075022+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T13:57:19.732242+00:00","content_hash":"fb91b1fc1cf367c9003c9c38e40da8701f596916516d8961a594f934007e67f9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}